4
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,700
(Congrats to our grand prize winner!
Prize money: 100,000 yuan)

5
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:31,060
♪I count your sighs♪

6
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:34,800
♪Every breath♪

7
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,500
♪Feels like I'm stealing♪

8
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,990
♪The next second♪

9
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:44,220
♪Before it's no longer mine♪

10
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:50,020
♪We live♪
(Capernaum)

11
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:54,550
♪In the spaces between moments♪

12
00:00:56,180 --> 00:01:01,350
♪Breathing through each other's shadows♪

13
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:04,800
♪Let's not speak of what's to come♪

14
00:01:05,250 --> 00:01:08,300
♪Or what came before♪

15
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:14,510
♪This moment could last me a lifetime♪
(12:00-11:50 PM)

16
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:20,980
=Thirteen Types of Love=
=Episode 2=

17
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,440
Uh, I need to see Lin Duo. It's urgent.

18
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,560
Could you get her for me?

19
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:26,280
The player's quitting.

20
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,120
Next player, get ready.

21
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:32,400
Never mind.

22
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:35,240
He just went in. He's got a death wish.

23
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,680
(Why bother going in?)

24
00:01:37,960 --> 00:01:39,080
(The NPC isn't even inside yet.)

25
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:02,840
Is Lin Duo in this universe

26
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:04,840
really that brave?

27
00:02:04,940 --> 00:02:06,220
(Black or White)

28
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,320
I don't wanna play.

29
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:20,560
My Lin Duo isn't supposed
to be this brave.

30
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:24,960
Duo!

31
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:26,960
Duo!

32
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:31,400
(Countdown: 00:08-00:04)

33
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:39,840
Zhang! Stop eating!

34
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,160
Hurry! Get to work!

35
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:41,960
The player's gone in!

36
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:42,840
There's no NPC in there!

37
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,280
Hurry!

38
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,320
What's that?

39
00:02:46,320 --> 00:02:49,220
(October 28th, 2025, Tuesday, 12:02:10)

40
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,240
What?

41
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:52,720
There's nothing here.

42
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:58,200
Then where is our NPC?

43
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,640
You've got time to take photos
at a time like this?

44
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:06,520
Sir,

45
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,400
if it won't open, just leave it.

46
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:09,920
Almost got it!

47
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,040
Give me a second.

48
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,000
Lin Duo!

49
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,200
Lin Duo!

50
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,320
Lin Duo!

51
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:41,600
Lin Duo!

52
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,040
Whoa!

53
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:12,800
Something's wrong!

54
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,280
Quick!

55
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:13,920
What's going on?

56
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,240
- Go, now!
- Hurry!

57
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:15,800
Get out of here!

58
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,240
Quick!

59
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:27,920
This way!

60
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:33,360
Forty-one, forty-two, forty-three...

61
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,120
- Forty-four...
- What happened?

62
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:34,720
- Forty-five...
- What's going on?

63
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,920
Forty-six, forty-seven...

64
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:36,920
What's wrong with the customer?

65
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:43,480
What happened?

66
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,320
He stuck his tongue out!

67
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:47,680
His tongue?

68
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:49,720
What a creep!

69
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:50,960
Lin Duo,

70
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,760
I finally found you.

71
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:53,880
When did you wake up?

72
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,440
When you kissed me the first time.

73
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:56,640
- Oh, man!
- I...

74
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,240
You pervert!

75
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:58,880
I...

76
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:03,560
You little...

77
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:05,680
Go to hell!

78
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:10,600
(You have a death wish?)

79
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,160
I'm so sorry.

80
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,600
She hit you too hard.

81
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:23,040
Apologize to the customer.

82
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:23,840
It's okay.

83
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,680
I just want to say a few words
to Lin Duo.

84
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,440
I could sue you for this.

85
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:31,960
Apologize to him.

86
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,840
Look what you did to him!

87
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,760
You're lucky he didn't press charges.

88
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,040
I'm sorry.

89
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,520
I'm Zhang Yongsen.

90
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,360
And you're Lin Duo.

91
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:50,680
I know you want to be an actress.

92
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,280
I can help you.

93
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:54,880
I can help you
make your dream come true.

94
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:55,600
I...

95
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,400
I can support you.

96
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,040
I'll work to put you through school.

97
00:05:58,680 --> 00:05:59,640
Just like before.

98
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:02,000
I knew you could do it!

99
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,960
You really got in!

100
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,720
I really got into
the Communication University!

101
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:10,760
Hold on.

102
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,160
What century are you living in?

103
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:14,960
Women need freedom and independence.

104
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:15,600
Got it?

105
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,120
Listen, buddy.

106
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:20,960
I can work for what I want on my own.

107
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:22,080
I worked three months

108
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,320
to pay my tuition,

109
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:24,520
earned a merit scholarship,

110
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:26,360
and that's how
I got this acceptance letter.

111
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,280
I don't need some stranger's

112
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,800
weird sense of superiority,

113
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,760
mixed with sexism,

114
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:34,560
plus a smug little superiority complex.

115
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:38,360
(She's really nothing like
the Lin Duo I know.)

116
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,600
You just said "superiority" twice.

117
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,560
Did she?

118
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:44,440
Yeah.

119
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,200
Did I forget to say I don't know him?

120
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:47,880
Nope.

121
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,360
Bye.

122
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:50,280
Hold it!

123
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:53,520
Lin Duo!

124
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:55,480
I'm your husband!

125
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,120
I came from the future.

126
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,200
I have medicine
that can cure your illness.

127
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:18,920
(What's happening?)

128
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,240
(You have a death wish?)
(Here we go again?)

129
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:23,160
(System reset?)

130
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:24,480
So...

131
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,680
I can't just tell her who I am.

132
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,000
I'm so sorry.

133
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,080
She hit you too hard.

134
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,720
Apologize to the customer.

135
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:36,000
I'm sorry.

136
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,280
No, no! Not you!

137
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:37,840
Her.

138
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:39,600
Lin Duo,

139
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:40,880
I'm sorry.

140
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:45,920
Do you know me?

141
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:48,560
I love you.

142
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,280
Go out with him!

143
00:07:55,640 --> 00:08:01,960
Say yes!

144
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:05,960
Say yes!

145
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:12,280
Say yes!

146
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:15,360
Duo, wait!

147
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:16,760
Can we talk?

148
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:17,480
Just five minutes.

149
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:19,080
Look, buddy.

150
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:20,840
I really don't know you.

151
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,640
Lin Duo,

152
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:24,680
your birthday is May 27th.

153
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,440
You want to act. You love Xilele's buns.

154
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,520
You don't sweat the small stuff,
and you're a scaredy-cat.

155
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:28,320
But here, in this universe,

156
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,320
you're fearless.

157
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,600
I filled out a form when I applied.

158
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,600
Anyone who saw it would know.

159
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,520
Your left breast is bigger
than your right.

160
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:37,400
And on your right butt cheek,

161
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:38,680
you've got a triangle-shaped scar

162
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:39,720
from sitting on a power strip as a kid.

163
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,520
It looks just like this.

164
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,960
I don't care how long

165
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:46,720
you've been spying on me.

166
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,560
If I ever catch you again,

167
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:50,360
you're dead.

168
00:08:58,560 --> 00:08:59,080
(Remember.)

169
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,600
(She has to fall in love with you)

170
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:02,040
(for the medicine to work.)

171
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:03,800
(That is the most important rule.)

172
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,280
(Remember.)

173
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,200
(It has to be love.)

174
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,800
(Not pity.)

175
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,400
(Not gratitude.)

176
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:19,120
Morning!

177
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:20,280
You haven't had breakfast, right?

178
00:09:20,780 --> 00:09:21,600
(Xilele Steamed Buns)

179
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,960
Xilele's breakfast buns.

180
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:27,280
You claim to
know me so well, Zhang Yongsen.

181
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:29,160
I don't like stuffed buns.

182
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,000
Don't you know that?

183
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,040
And guess what?

184
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:36,240
Hold these for me.

185
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,960
There's no filling.

186
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:47,480
No filling?

187
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:48,960
Then that's a plain steamed bun.

188
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:51,880
You love their buns,

189
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,480
but the filling has fatty pork.

190
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:54,760
So you split them open
and eat just the dough.

191
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:56,920
I got there at 3 AM

192
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,520
and had the owner
add filling for flavor,

193
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,720
then shake it all back out.

194
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,600
First time he ever made
an air-filled steamed bun.

195
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,760
It was pretty tricky.

196
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,560
But luckily,

197
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:05,200
I was there to show him how.

198
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,520
So how is that different

199
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,920
from taking the filling out

200
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,000
after the bao is made?

201
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:17,200
No difference.

202
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,960
Actually, there is.

203
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,000
Does it taste any different?

204
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,600
This is the difference.

205
00:10:28,650 --> 00:10:29,910
Stop coming to see me.

206
00:10:32,110 --> 00:10:34,260
(The Lin Duo in this universe
is hard to get close to.)

207
00:10:34,260 --> 00:10:37,700
(But no matter what,
I have to save my Lin Duo.)

208
00:10:50,690 --> 00:10:51,520
Listen up, everybody!

209
00:10:51,942 --> 00:10:53,657
Our TV-and-online escape room livestream
is about to start!

210
00:10:54,500 --> 00:10:55,180
Mild Horror group!

211
00:10:55,420 --> 00:10:55,980
Atmosphere crew!

212
00:10:55,980 --> 00:10:56,651
Get moving!

213
00:10:57,370 --> 00:10:58,140
Come on, everyone!

214
00:10:58,140 --> 00:10:59,062
Keep those hands moving!

215
00:10:59,062 --> 00:11:00,080
Listen up!

216
00:11:00,548 --> 00:11:01,360
For this competition,

217
00:11:01,542 --> 00:11:03,554
we brought in the hottest
escape-room influencer to direct.

218
00:11:03,942 --> 00:11:04,777
Whatever he says,

219
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:06,102
you do it. Got that?

220
00:11:08,445 --> 00:11:11,050
The company's put everything into this.

221
00:11:11,050 --> 00:11:12,045
We're going all in.

222
00:11:12,297 --> 00:11:13,130
If we pull this off,

223
00:11:13,130 --> 00:11:14,491
we'll be on top of the world!

224
00:11:15,211 --> 00:11:16,502
And if we fail?

225
00:11:17,782 --> 00:11:19,120
We will succeed.

226
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,730
I even invested my own paycheck!

227
00:11:20,730 --> 00:11:22,880
You're the best of the best,

228
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:24,251
picked from 1,000 players!

229
00:11:24,548 --> 00:11:25,760
If you clear all the challenges,

230
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:27,760
you win 10 million yuan!

231
00:11:28,777 --> 00:11:29,611
Ten million?

232
00:11:30,068 --> 00:11:32,000
You can win ten million from this?

233
00:11:32,514 --> 00:11:33,565
Who wants ten million?

234
00:11:33,771 --> 00:11:34,260
I do!

235
00:11:34,260 --> 00:11:35,622
I just want Lin Duo.

236
00:11:45,337 --> 00:11:48,765
♪Does fate write every hello♪

237
00:11:48,770 --> 00:11:50,994
♪With a goodbye in mind?♪

238
00:11:57,220 --> 00:12:00,980
♪Does longing give us a beginning♪

239
00:12:00,980 --> 00:12:03,140
♪And leave us without an ending?♪

240
00:12:08,980 --> 00:12:13,380
♪I remember the way you breathe♪

241
00:12:14,860 --> 00:12:17,420
♪Countless versions of me♪

242
00:12:18,540 --> 00:12:24,260
♪All point in the same direction♪

243
00:12:24,500 --> 00:12:28,100
♪Toward you♪

244
00:12:29,540 --> 00:12:31,340
♪I'll find you♪

245
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:33,940
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

246
00:12:34,900 --> 00:12:37,060
♪I'll find you♪

247
00:12:37,060 --> 00:12:39,780
♪In the instant
before anything is decided♪

248
00:12:40,580 --> 00:12:42,740
♪I'll find you♪

249
00:12:42,740 --> 00:12:45,420
♪In the gaps
where time overlaps and slips♪

250
00:12:46,300 --> 00:12:48,180
♪I'll find you♪

251
00:12:52,380 --> 00:12:53,980
♪I'll find you♪

252
00:12:54,300 --> 00:12:56,940
♪In the promises left unsaid♪

253
00:12:57,740 --> 00:12:59,660
♪I'll find you♪

254
00:12:59,860 --> 00:13:02,580
♪In every pause between heartbeats♪

255
00:13:03,380 --> 00:13:05,380
♪I'll find you♪

256
00:13:05,540 --> 00:13:08,140
♪Where the last faint light fades♪

257
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:11,500
♪I'll find you♪

258
00:13:14,860 --> 00:13:20,740
♪I'll find you♪
